      "id": "sgk_QA_SIMPLE_INTEREST_W11_B2_00009",
      "stem": "A sum of Rs. 15,000 is divided into two parts. One part is lent at 5% per annum and the other at 8% per annum. If the total interest from both parts after 1 year is Rs. 930, what is the sum lent at 5%?",
