      "correct_letter": "C",
      "difficulty": "HARD",
      "explanation": "C is correct. Let sum at 5% = x. Sum at 8% = (15000-x). Interest equation: x×5/100 + (15000-x)×8/100 = 930. Multiply by 100: 5x + 120000-8x = 93000. -3x = -27000. x = Rs. 9,000. Verify: 9000×5/100=450; 6000×8/100=480; 450+480=930 ✓. Trap: Rs. 10,000 at 5% → 500; 5000 at 8% → 400; total=900≠930 (wrong); Rs. 7,000 at 5% → 350; 8000 at 8% → 640; total=990≠930 (wrong).",
